  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The wavelength of an electron of kinetic energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>29</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>________</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo></math> (Nearest integer) Given: mass of electron is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Js</mi></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Given:<br />Kinetic energy(K.E.)=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>29</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br />Mass of electron<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup><mi>kg</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sec</mi></math></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">debroglie wavelength&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi>mv</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>mKE</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math> is the de Broglie wavelength, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math> is Planck&#39;s constant, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is the mass of the particle, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math> is its velocity, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> is the momentum of the particle, which is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mv</mi></math>.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>mKE</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>29</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>66</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
